| | |
|---|---|
| Released baseline | tag **`v1.0.5`** = `main` = `dd3336c` (the published release; the live Pi runs this) |
| Current work | branch **`feature/admin-hardening`**, pushed to `origin` (never force-push, never move a tag). Find the live tip with `git log -1` — this digest pins stage 3, not every later docs commit |
